================================================================================
            CSC1103/1104 MINI-PROJECT MAKEFILE COMMAND REFERENCE SHEET
================================================================================

1. DEFAULT GROUP 09 BUILD & VALIDATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
make                : Builds all binaries for Group 09 (Short=15, Long=100)
make check          : Runs test20 correctness validation (Short=3, Long=5)
make clean          : Removes bin/ and plots/ build directories
make clean && make  : Performs a complete fresh rebuild of all targets


2. COMPILATION & BUILD TARGETS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
make stage0         : Builds Stage 0 loop & recursion targets (-O0, -O1, -O2, -O3)
make test_tradeio   : Builds standalone trade_io module test
make test_vwap      : Builds standalone VWAP indicator test
make test_ohlc      : Builds standalone OHLC bar indicator test
make test_sma       : Builds standalone SMA indicator test
make test_signal    : Builds standalone Signal Crossover test
make stageA         : Builds Stage A streaming engine (trade_io)
make test20         : Builds test20 validation engine (Short=3, Long=5)
make stageA_plus    : Builds Stage A+ fast parser engine (fast_reader)
make stageB         : Builds all 4 Stage B variants (naive, running, fp, malloc)
make stageB_naive   : Builds Stage B O(N) naive array engine
make stageB_running : Builds Stage B O(1) running-sum engine
make stageB_fp      : Builds Stage B fixed-point integer engine (long long)
make stageB_malloc  : Builds Stage B exact-fit dynamic memory engine
make stageC         : Builds Stage C real-time replay & rival bot engine


3. PARAMETER & BENCHMARK OVERRIDES (COMPILER FLAGS)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test Other Group Parameters (e.g. Group 01: 10/60, Group 15: 10/200)
make SHORT_N=10 LONG_N=60
make SHORT_N=10 LONG_N=200

# Optimization & Architecture Flags (Pi 5 Cortex-A76 Benchmarking)
make OPT=-O3
make CPU=-mcpu=cortex-a76
make OPT=-O3 CPU=-mcpu=cortex-a76


